This is a scoped TypeScript adaptation, not the complete noformat filter: only
pix_fmts names that parseFilterPixelFormat declares are accepted, duplicates are
refused, and the color_spaces, color_ranges and alpha_modes lists, enable= and
runtime commands are refused before output.
